    "Description": "### Impact\nUnder certain local upload configurations, an uploaded XML file and stylesheet could execute JavaScript in the Payload origin when a logged-in user opens the file.\n\nYou are affected if:\n- You accept XML uploads (accepted by default).\n\n### Patches\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `\u003e= 3.90.0` or `\u003e= 4.0.0-canary.34`.\n\n### Workarounds\nDisallow XML/XSL uploads.",
